240	EMMS marks every register empty
241	FXSAVE stores an MMX value as the significand
242	with the sign and exponent all ones
243	FXRSTOR brings mm0 back exactly
244	FXRSTOR brings mm5 back exactly
245	FXRSTOR brings mm7 back exactly
